{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_18260680","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"18260680","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:1:1826066001:":{"text":"这就是和我作对的下场！呸！","source_cn":"这就是和我作对的下场！呸！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6B8CFFACEA6E7D2A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:1:1826066002:":{"text":"哈哈，竟然是你","source_cn":"哈哈，竟然是你","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xABF7E30BCC18D22C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1826067001:1":{"text":"哎呀呀……托安竟然只派了一个扭曲的双头怪物来诺珐斯……","source_cn":"哎呀呀……托安竟然只派了一个扭曲的双头怪物来诺珐斯……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x644F5A804D2116F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1826067002:1":{"text":"怎么，班题斯的将军和统帅全都化作骨灰了吗？","source_cn":"怎么，班题斯的将军和统帅全都化作骨灰了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x217D13EEE9879219","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1826067003:1":{"text":"哼，收复诺珐斯根本用不着将军出马，只靠马尔就能将这里夷为平地！","source_cn":"哼，收复诺珐斯根本用不着将军出马，只靠马尔就能将这里夷...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3369F859A805AFD8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1826067004:1":{"text":"马尔的锤子——比将军更厉害！","source_cn":"马尔的锤子——比将军更厉害！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7D77B6FAC4250EBE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1826067005:1":{"text":"呵呵，是吗？不知格瑞泽尔勒卿苏醒了没有？","source_cn":"呵呵，是吗？不知格瑞泽尔勒卿苏醒了没有？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC469F5988BD3DD32","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1826067006:1":{"text":"他可是班题斯帝国最骁勇善战的将军，也是托安最信任的禁卫军长官。若是他就此一睡不起，你们的陛下一定会非常、非常非常地伤心……","source_cn":"他可是班题斯帝国最骁勇善战的将军，也是托安最信任的禁卫...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9D51C20E38B50620","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1826067007:1":{"text":"不过，若是你们兄弟俩遭遇此事，你们说，托安会作何反应？","source_cn":"不过，若是你们兄弟俩遭遇此事，你们说，托安会作何反应？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x144BD61DA53D115C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1826067008:1":{"text":"哦……余知道了。托安一定会把你们剁碎丢进乱葬岗，再制成和垃杜一样的怪物——虽然以你们现在的模样也相差无几，呵呵。","source_cn":"哦……余知道了。托安一定会把你们剁碎丢进乱葬岗，再制成...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x227F8844D154269A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1826067009:1":{"text":"你……你竟敢侮辱陛下？！简直不知死活！","source_cn":"你……你竟敢侮辱陛下？！简直不知死活！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4105DC69E1C95AD5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1826067010:1":{"text":"侮辱他又如何？难不成班题斯真的天真地以为，诺珐斯无力与你们抗争？","source_cn":"侮辱他又如何？难不成班题斯真的天真地以为，诺珐斯无力与...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2EC77DF66A0314CB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1826067011:1":{"text":"回去转告托安，恭喜他和格瑞泽尔勒猜对了，余从未真心臣服过。班题斯的所作所为，从来都令余、令莫蒂默家族不齿！","source_cn":"回去转告托安，恭喜他和格瑞泽尔勒猜对了，余从未真心臣服...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE97F23213DA57542","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1826067012:1":{"text":"你这狂妄的家伙！别以为黑金商会还会为你背书，你们那个老大已经抛弃你了！","source_cn":"你这狂妄的家伙！别以为黑金商会还会为你背书，你们那个老...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD3DA1BA4B89BE9C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1826067013:1":{"text":"多谢你的提醒，余差点忘记和班题斯狼狈为奸的还有“傲慢”这号人物。","source_cn":"多谢你的提醒，余差点忘记和班题斯狼狈为奸的还有“傲慢”...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8A47731AA11D38EB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1826067014:1":{"text":"告诉他，余已经借用“懒惰”的名号达成了目的，往后随便他将这名号丢给什么小猫小狗，余都不介意。但可千万记住，别再上当哦。","source_cn":"告诉他，余已经借用“懒惰”的名号达成了目的，往后随便他...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3C0ADE1E4F664242","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1826067015:1":{"text":"余还会将爱德华押送往耀光帝国，相信他们一定非常乐于了解黑金商会的种种……辛苦筹谋。","source_cn":"余还会将爱德华押送往耀光帝国，相信他们一定非常乐于了解...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x53156E7E0188BA76","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1826067016:1":{"text":"而现在——该你们滚出诺珐斯了。","source_cn":"而现在——该你们滚出诺珐斯了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7EACE336A95DB27B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1826067017:1":{"text":"<shk>你休想！！</shk>","source_cn":"<shk>你休想！！</shk>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6CCA2392502797E1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:22:1826067901:":{"text":"哼……","source_cn":"哼……<key:dialog88>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6841C5CF2D37CAC8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:23:1826068001:1":{"text":"随着喀尔马的脚步，班题斯大军气势汹汹地奔向城门","source_cn":"","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x904549556A114451","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:24:1826068002:1":{"text":"与此同时，一个巨大的血阵在他们脚下浮现，随即迸发出一道可怕的魔法光柱！","source_cn":"","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x52634E0E576ED5CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:25:1826068003:0":{"text":"惨厉的叫声此起彼伏，许多诺珐斯居民都惊恐地闭上了双眼","source_cn":"惨厉的叫声此起彼伏，许多诺珐斯居民都惊恐地闭上了双眼","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD207396110D51346","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:26:1826068004:1":{"text":"当魔法光柱消散后，苔佩希的面前只剩下奄奄一息的喀尔马和翼，以及飘散的灰尘……","source_cn":"","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x07EC97E7FB73B594","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:28:1826068101:":{"text":"只凭你们，可不是余的对手","source_cn":"只凭你们，可不是余的对手","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D570BE73F62E92A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:28:1826068102:":{"text":"来两个守卫，把他们押到牢里","source_cn":"来两个守卫，把他们押到牢里","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E8FC7DE47E2A8DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_tit